    "background": {
      "label": "专业背景",
      "lede": "多指井径仪沿深度记录不同方位的内壁半径。仪器偏心会让整圈出现平滑起伏，局部内壁凹坑则只占较小的深度和方位范围。",
      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "CONCEPT",
          "title": "从圆周到展开图",
          "html": "<p>横轴是方位角0–360°，纵轴是深度。把一圈测点展开，就能同时看到缺陷持续多深、覆盖多少方位。颜色表示相对名义内半径的偏差，不是照片颜色。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"从圆周到展开图\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"210\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f5f4\"/><g fill=\"#254755\" font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"17\"><rect x=\"35\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"52\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"69\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"86\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"103\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"137\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"154\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"171\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"188\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"205\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"222\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"239\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"256\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"273\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"290\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"307\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"324\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"341\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"358\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"375\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"392\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"409\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" fill=\"#bed7d2\"/><rect x=\"426\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"